<title>PORTUGAL: INSTANT VIEW - Semapa 1996 results.</title>
<headline>INSTANT VIEW - Semapa 1996 results.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are reactions to the 1996 results of Portuguese cement firm Semapa, which reported a profit of 3.665 billion escudos, up from 1.77 billion in 1995.</p>
<p>JOAO VERMELHO, CENTRAL DE INVESTIMENTOS</p>
<p>&quot;Semapa's results were very good and I think the share could test 3,500 escudos.&quot;</p>
<p>JOSE FREIRE, ESPIRITO SANTO RESEARCH</p>
<p>&quot;Semapa's results came out within the expectations of most analysts, who expected profits around 3.3 billion escudos, but the numbers are very good and the share price could rise.&quot;</p>
<p>- Paula Cordeiro, Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
